atomicassets-api
================

This project is a continuation of the `eosio-contract-api` originally
developed by Pink Network at Spielworks Markets GmbH:

    https://github.com/pinknetworkx/eosio-contract-api

The codebase has been carried forward and is now stewarded by FACINGS
INC. through the AtomicHub team. We thank Pink Network for their
original work on the AtomicAssets indexer and HTTP API.

